@SideLearning.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7188
@accessToken = your_access_token_here

### Health
GET {{SideLearning.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### List topics (public)
GET {{SideLearning.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/topics?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

###

### Register
POST {{SideLearning.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password1!",
  "displayName": "Test User"
}

###

### Login
POST {{SideLearning.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

###

### Create topic (requires Bearer token)
POST {{SideLearning.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/topics
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Linear Algebra"
}

###
